ted delivery.\",\n      \"alternativeComparison\": \"Alternative a escalates after successful compliance by undoing the task; alternative b escalates after B reveals the physical discomfort of obeying.\",\n      \"reason\": \"Retained unchanged: B4's completed delivery enables the unnecessary return and stricter compliance condition. Internal rereading confirms the original ratings.\",\n      \"reservation\": \"The added inconvenience is modest in distance, though the wasted trip and prohibition on questions clearly increase the test.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"exampleId\": \"D59-single-b\",\n      \"beforeHash\": \"b42f02c93597542a773ec7f533ae67f1683994bef2547d5baedca01f0fa9fd21\",\n      \"firstPass\": {\n        \"ratings\": {\n          \"cardFidelity\": {\"score\": 4, \"evidence\": \"A3 explicitly tests obedience without explanation, but A5's window closure may reduce inconvenience rather than increase it.\"},\n          \"responseLogic\": {\"score\": 4, \"evidence\": \"B2's question causes A3's explanation test; B4's cold causes A5's closure request, though 'remain instructional' is unclear.\"},\n          \"relationship\": {\"score\": 3, \"evidence\": \"B2 seeks purpose and B4 reports discomfort, but A5 gives B no clear continuing physical task beyond closure.\"},\n          \"heightening\": {\"score\": 2, \"evidence\": \"A5 removes B4's source of discomfort and substitutes vague wording instead of a clearly greater inconvenience.\"},\n          \"specificity\": {\"score\": 3, \"evidence\": \"A1 supplies a window but no relationship or purpose; A5's 'remain instructional' is difficult to enact.\"},\n          \"brevityWit\": {\"score\": 2, \"evidence\": \"A5's 'remain instructional' strains for a phrase that does not specify what B should do.\"}\n        },\n        \"weightedTotal\": 65\n      },\n      \"beats\": [\n        {\"speaker\": \"A\", \"text\": \"Leave your desk and stand by that open window.\"},\n        {\"speaker\": \"B\", \"text\": \"Why?\"},\n